    "message": "Check that cited evidence IDs are in the source manifest\n\nCollect the ASM- and SRC- IDs written as fixed strings in src/ and fail\non any that is neither in fixtures/source-manifest.json nor a known gap.\nThe 70 current gaps are listed by kind: described elsewhere, not described\nanywhere, runtime public data providers and operator input. Runtime-built\nIDs and startswith prefixes are skipped. The gap lists may only shrink for\nassumptions; what the manifest records stays with the model owner.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
